  "model": "Atlas runs a seed-led model: partners and entrepreneurs-in-residence scout academic and pharma science, then incubate companies in-house with small seed tranches that are released as key experiments read out. Successful seeds graduate into Series A launches alongside syndicate partners, building both platform and single-asset companies.",
